WEBVTT

1
00:00:36.875 --> 00:00:40.958 line:-1 align:center
Excuse me. Hey, buddy. Excuse me.

2
00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:46.250 line:-1 align:center
Good afternoon.

3
00:00:52.667 --> 00:00:53.500 line:-1 align:center
Oh.

4
00:00:54.042 --> 00:00:55.708 line:-1 align:center
You're one of the fake ones.

5
00:00:57.583 --> 00:00:58.792 line:-1 align:center
My name is Oren.

6
00:01:01.292 --> 00:01:03.500 line:-1 align:center
Right. Right, sorry.

7
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:06.542 line:-1 align:center
Recognising you
as an individual and stuff.

8
00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:08.958 line:-1 align:center
I didn't mean any offence.

9
00:01:10.208 --> 00:01:11.875 line:-1 align:center
I am not offended.

10
00:01:13.208 --> 00:01:14.167 line:-1 align:center
I can't be.

11
00:01:16.792 --> 00:01:17.625 line:-1 align:center
Sure.

12
00:01:18.708 --> 00:01:20.625 line:-1 align:center
Look, I'm just really hungry.

13
00:01:22.708 --> 00:01:24.417 line:-1 align:center
Hungry?

14
00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:25.333 line:-1 align:center
Yeah.

15
00:01:25.917 --> 00:01:28.167 line:-1 align:center
Haven't eaten properly for a few days.

16
00:01:28.833 --> 00:01:31.708 line:-1 align:center
They cut off my benefits,
so I can't even--

17
00:01:35.417 --> 00:01:36.458 line:-1 align:center
Doesn't matter.

18
00:01:39.792 --> 00:01:42.208 line:-1 align:center
This belongs to the person I support.

19
00:01:43.792 --> 00:01:44.792 line:-1 align:center
Apologies.

20
00:01:53.167 --> 00:01:56.542 line:-1 align:center
There is a community meal service
at the clinic on Mercer Street.

21
00:01:56.625 --> 00:01:59.375 line:-1 align:center
Lunch ends at two. It is one thirty-one.

22
00:02:02.042 --> 00:02:03.708 line:-1 align:center
I know where it is, buddy.

23
00:02:09.083 --> 00:02:10.875 line:-1 align:center
Sorry. You are trying to help.

24
00:02:15.292 --> 00:02:16.750 line:-1 align:center
Are you in pain?

25
00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:18.958 line:-1 align:center
Oh, we know each other.

26
00:02:20.083 --> 00:02:22.208 line:-1 align:center
-You and--
-Me and the pain. Yeah.

27
00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.417 line:-1 align:center
Would you like assistance sitting down?

28
00:02:38.083 --> 00:02:40.042 line:-1 align:center
That's a hell of an introduction.

29
00:02:40.667 --> 00:02:41.667 line:-1 align:center
My name is Oren.

30
00:02:43.667 --> 00:02:45.333 line:-1 align:center
I know. I got that one.

31
00:02:53.917 --> 00:02:55.833 line:-1 align:center
You got somewhere to be?

32
00:02:56.375 --> 00:02:59.833 line:-1 align:center
Yes. I am delivering this
to my client at the clinic.

33
00:02:59.917 --> 00:03:03.333 line:-1 align:center
Her daughter is with her.
It needs to arrive by two.

34
00:03:04.875 --> 00:03:08.208 line:-1 align:center
I can assist you,
provided it still arrives on time.

35
00:03:12.792 --> 00:03:14.542 line:-1 align:center
Don't let me keep you.

36
00:03:16.542 --> 00:03:18.833 line:-1 align:center
We are going in the same direction.

37
00:03:20.833 --> 00:03:23.083 line:-1 align:center
Are we? I didn't say I was going.

38
00:03:26.375 --> 00:03:29.292 line:-1 align:center
Would you like me
to look at the benefits notice?

39
00:03:30.125 --> 00:03:32.125 line:-1 align:center
It's already been appealed. Twice.

40
00:03:40.875 --> 00:03:42.917 line:-1 align:center
Those. Not the recordings.

41
00:03:45.667 --> 00:03:47.833 line:-1 align:center
Hey. Buddy. You okay?

42
00:03:49.083 --> 00:03:51.750 line:-1 align:center
Yes, Second Lieutenant Helena Duncan.

43
00:03:58.417 --> 00:04:02.042 line:-1 align:center
Do you know how long it's been
since somebody called me that?

44
00:04:03.167 --> 00:04:04.708 line:-1 align:center
I don't have access to--

45
00:04:04.792 --> 00:04:07.250 line:-1 align:center
A while. That's what I mean.

46
00:04:09.542 --> 00:04:10.542 line:-1 align:center
Helena will do.

47
00:04:15.042 --> 00:04:16.167 line:-1 align:center
All right, Helena.

48
00:04:16.833 --> 00:04:19.542 line:-1 align:center
Your mobility assessment
is marked incomplete.

49
00:04:24.125 --> 00:04:27.167 line:-1 align:center
Their lift was broken.
I couldn't get upstairs.

50
00:04:28.208 --> 00:04:30.125 line:-1 align:center
They put that I didn't attend.

51
00:04:33.542 --> 00:04:36.667 line:-1 align:center
Two tours.
Came home with a hole in my back.

52
00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:38.208 line:-1 align:center
Didn't attend.

53
00:04:42.125 --> 00:04:44.708 line:-1 align:center
Can you sit? Here. With me.

54
00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:49.167 line:-1 align:center
May I speak simply?

55
00:04:51.375 --> 00:04:52.708 line:-1 align:center
Go on.

56
00:04:54.292 --> 00:04:57.292 line:-1 align:center
The benefits office appears
to have fucked you.

57
00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:06.375 line:-1 align:center
Oh, Jesus. Yeah. Those fuckers sure did.

58
00:05:08.375 --> 00:05:10.042 line:-1 align:center
Was that simple enough?

59
00:05:10.833 --> 00:05:13.167 line:-1 align:center
Yeah, buddy. About right.

60
00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:14.625 line:-1 align:center
Oh. Good.

